  "body": "These brand-new, standalone homes offer the perfect balance of style, convenience, and lifestyle in sought-after Campbells Bay.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\r\n• Brand new standalone home on 200sqm freehold land\r\n• Approx. 155 sqm floor area with a smart modern layout\r\n• Light-filled open plan living and dining\r\n• Stylish contemporary kitchen with quality appliances\r\n• Spacious bedrooms and beautifully appointed bathrooms\r\n• Easy-care outdoor area perfect for relaxing or entertaining\r\n• Ideal lock-up-and-leave or family home\r\n\r\nPrime Location\r\n\r\nLocated in a quiet and desirable street, you are just minutes from the stunning Campbells Bay Beach, local cafés, parks, and coastal walkways. Enjoy the convenience of nearby shopping at Mairangi Bay Village and Albany Westfield.\r\n\r\nTop School Zones\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate being in zone for some of the North Shore's most sought-after schools, including:\r\n\r\n• Campbells Bay School\r\n• Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n• Westlake Boys High School\r\n• Westlake Girls High School\r\n• Rangitoto College\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a family home, investment, or coastal lifestyle upgrade, this brand new property offers exceptional value in one of the North Shore's most desirable neighbourhoods. Move in, relax, and enjoy everything Campbells Bay has to offer.\r\n\r\nMotivated vendor is serious about selling! Contact us today for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
